<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley details Rambus.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley details Rambus.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley confirmed it initiated coverage of Rambus Inc with an outperform rating and set a 12-month price target of $42 a share.</p>
<p>-- said it expects Rambus to earn $0.05 a share in fiscal 1997, $0.20 a share in fiscal 1998 and $0.47 a share in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- Rambus gained 1-1/4 to 31-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley was the lead underwriter of Rambus' May 14 initial public offering.</p>
</text>
